{
  "song_id": 11119781,
  "title": "Lactose and Lecithin (EZAC Mix)",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    712,
    70
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Somewheres out in cop-killer Queens",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Where bo deans stop limousines and niggas flee the scene",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Somebody on his back bleeding vest all cracked up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "\"Freeze clown, officer down, request for back up\"",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Listen dude don't get me misconstrued as a sniper",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "It's V Vaughn, not to be confused with V, La Viper",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Or either Peter Parker, or either Peter Piper",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "A seed the type to pee the diaper blame it on the wiper",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "\"It's really not your concern why I got the knife, sir\"",
          "rhyme": "iR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "He suggest remain calm, let's not get -- \"No!\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Slash his windpipe, he had them type of eyes",
          "rhyme": "Ej",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "He might be still alive, how you get this thing to hyper drive?",
          "rhyme": "ajv",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Oh, give my props to the shooter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Prices at a all time low in the future",
          "rhyme": "yR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Something like 14, they must be on horse pills",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "OT and zero-three to re-up on force fields",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "At that cost, deal, he plotted the coordinates",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "2003 winter time upper west side, more or less",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "This thing be buggin' like a celly frontin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Who the hell is honey with the slug in her belly, stuntin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "You ain't have to tell V nuthin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Trust him, it really ain't no time for discussion",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "He'd be back in '93, press of a button, and they busted in",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "His first impulse was to smack the dirt",
          "rhyme": "9Rt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "All four wore plain clothes and lumberjack shirt",
          "rhyme": "9Rt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Recognize one face from school six degrees ago",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "He'd snuff him in his braces just to switch the station to BGO",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "He kept a punchline every lunch break, lunch time",
          "rhyme": "ajm",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "And this is no time to pump fake, it's crunch time",
          "rhyme": "ajm",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "The same split second, they let off the toast",
          "rhyme": "ost",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "That's when he hit the speed dial and sped off, ghost",
          "rhyme": "Ost",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "I know those cats don't like V",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "And if they took my head off they'd get off most likely",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "And probably thought the time gizmo was my wallet",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "And hit the hills, no, forty more times on some foul shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Pick a crime, he was out in the nick of time",
          "rhyme": "ajm",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "To get paid another day and live to kick a sicker rhyme",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "For iller, it's like Miller malt liquor time",
          "rhyme": "ajm",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Up town finery where it's probably not best to flaunt",
          "rhyme": "unt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Everyone's your best friend, V steps into the restaurant",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "\"My friend,\" he said, \"You must be psychic\"",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "\"What's the price of- \"Fourteen! It’s good, you like it!\"",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Huh, be back tonight",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "The fourteen G pack was really packed tight",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "But back at the lab he found the Sleestak was right",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "Not only was it three cracks light, but too white",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "The test show lactose, anbesol, lecithin",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "Five types of aspirin and other kinds of medicines",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "Next time I'll bring my men who speak Mexican",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "And let the Techs spin, make 'em contact the next of kin",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "The whole thing is mostly lactose, lecithin",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "And some type of aspirin, Anbesol medicine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "Damn, motherfucker",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "Let's go get 'em, men!",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCCDBBBEFGHBIJKLMNNAOAPPFFQQRSBTUVQWQXYZV[[[VAAYAAAD\\",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCCCBBBADEFBGAHFEIIAJACCDDFFDHBAEAFAFKLAAFFFAAALAAACE"
    }
  ]
}